WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.980
In this video, you choose the departments that can use a facility workspace. Step 1.

1.2
00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:07.276
Open the workspace.

1.3
00:00:07.276 --> 00:00:12.483
In the workspace list, select the workspace name, or Edit in its row.

2.1
00:00:12.483 --> 00:00:15.500
Step 2. Find the departments with access.

2.2
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:19.953
Open General settings to find the Departments with access section.

2.3
00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:24.906
If no department has access yet, it reads No departments selected.

3.1
00:00:24.906 --> 00:00:27.257
Step 3. Select the departments.

3.2
00:00:27.257 --> 00:00:32.003
In Select Department, select each department that needs the workspace.

3.3
00:00:32.003 --> 00:00:37.926
Departments above a selected department also get access, but not those below it.

4.1
00:00:37.926 --> 00:00:44.505
Step 4. Save the access. Select Save access, and Care shows Workspace access saved.

4.2
00:00:44.505 --> 00:00:48.284
Save Changes does not save the departments.
